{
  "title": "perf-sentinel findings",
  "uid": "perf-sentinel-findings",
  "tags": [
    "perf-sentinel",
    "observability"
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "editable": true,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "1m",
  "description": "Findings read from the perf-sentinel query API through the Infinity plugin (yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource), provisioned by examples/grafana-infinity-datasource.yaml. Companion to 'perf-sentinel overview', which reads Prometheus: that one answers how many findings and of what kind, this one answers which operation on which endpoint. The API it reads has no embedded IAM, so scope this dashboard's folder to the people allowed to see your SQL templates and endpoint names.",
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "DS_INFINITY",
        "label": "perf-sentinel API",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource",
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0,
        "includeAll": false,
        "multi": false
      },
      {
        "name": "limit",
        "label": "Max rows",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "50,100,200,500,1000",
        "current": {
          "text": "200",
          "value": "200"
        },
        "options": [
          {
            "selected": false,
            "text": "50",
            "value": "50"
          },
          {
            "selected": false,
            "text": "100",
            "value": "100"
          },
          {
            "selected": true,
            "text": "200",
            "value": "200"
          },
          {
            "selected": false,
            "text": "500",
            "value": "500"
          },
          {
            "selected": false,
            "text": "1000",
            "value": "1000"
          }
        ],
        "hide": 0,
        "includeAll": false,
        "multi": false,
        "description": "Server-side cap, applied after the API folds findings by signature. The daemon refuses anything above 1000."
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Findings",
      "description": "One row per distinct problem, not per detection: the API folds by the same signature acknowledgments use. Filter by severity, service or type with the column headers (every column is filterable) rather than a dashboard variable, so no request can ask the API for a severity it does not know.\n\n'Traces' is how many retained per-trace detections a row stands for: it falls as older ones age out of the daemon's ring buffer and resets when the daemon restarts, so read it as how present a problem is in the retained window, never as a lifetime total. 'Occurrences' is a different number, the repeats of that operation inside the single trace shown.\n\n'Est. impact (ops)' estimates each problem's aggregate avoidable I/O as Traces x Ops/trace, the same figure `query findings --sort impact` and the dashboard's impact sort rank by: an estimate, because the API folds detections and keeps one representative per signature. The table sorts by it by default, click any header to re-sort.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource",
        "uid": "${DS_INFINITY}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 16,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource",
            "uid": "${DS_INFINITY}"
          },
          "type": "json",
          "source": "url",
          "parser": "backend",
          "format": "table",
          "url": "/api/findings?limit=${limit}",
          "url_options": {
            "method": "GET"
          },
          "root_selector": "",
          "columns": [
            {
              "selector": "finding.severity",
              "text": "Severity",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "selector": "finding.type",
              "text": "Type",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "selector": "finding.service",
              "text": "Service",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "selector": "finding.source_endpoint",
              "text": "Endpoint",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "selector": "seen_count",
              "text": "Traces",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "selector": "finding.pattern.occurrences",
              "text": "Occurrences",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "selector": "finding.green_impact.estimated_extra_io_ops",
              "text": "Ops/trace",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "selector": "finding.pattern.template",
              "text": "Operation",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "selector": "finding.suggestion",
              "text": "Suggestion",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "selector": "finding.trace_id",
              "text": "Trace",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "selector": "stored_at_ms",
              "text": "Last seen",
              "type": "timestamp_epoch"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "filterable": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Severity"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.width",
                "value": 100
              },
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "critical": {
                        "color": "red",
                        "index": 0
                      },
                      "warning": {
                        "color": "orange",
                        "index": 1
                      },
                      "info": {
                        "color": "text",
                        "index": 2
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-text"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Operation"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.width",
                "value": 460
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Traces"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.width",
                "value": 80
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Occurrences"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.width",
                "value": 110
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Last seen"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.width",
                "value": 180
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Est. impact (ops)"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.width",
                "value": 130
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Ops/trace"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.width",
                "value": 100
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "displayName": "Est. impact (ops)",
            "desc": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "calculateField",
          "options": {
            "mode": "binary",
            "binary": {
              "left": "Traces",
              "operator": "*",
              "right": "Ops/trace"
            },
            "alias": "Est. impact (ops)"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Daemon acknowledgments",
      "description": "Findings acknowledged at runtime, from GET /api/acks. An entry here is usually why a problem is absent from the table above. Empty when [daemon.ack] is disabled. If the daemon has an ack API key, the datasource needs it too, this endpoint is gated by the same key as the ack writes.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource",
        "uid": "${DS_INFINITY}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource",
            "uid": "${DS_INFINITY}"
          },
          "type": "json",
          "source": "url",
          "parser": "backend",
          "format": "table",
          "url": "/api/acks",
          "url_options": {
            "method": "GET"
          },
          "root_selector": "",
          "columns": [
            {
              "selector": "signature",
              "text": "Signature",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "selector": "by",
              "text": "By",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "selector": "reason",
              "text": "Reason",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "selector": "at",
              "text": "Acknowledged",
              "type": "timestamp"
            },
            {
              "selector": "expires_at",
              "text": "Expires",
              "type": "timestamp"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "filterable": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Signature"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.width",
                "value": 420
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true
      }
    }
  ]
}